The is a kubernetes distributed system adoption for the homework3(The movie ticketing system). In my homework 3, each client has its corresponding backend. As there are 5 clients, this make it a lot of 10 running pods in the  kubernetes deployment. The original source code for homework 3 is modified and compiled , then made into a image and pushed into Dockerhub. For running this application on kubernetes, I use 10 yaml file each specifying the launching a statefulset on a single pod. A separate file used for each pod is because I attempt to specify a client with a specific index such as 1, this client can be mapped to a backend node with yaml file specifying its running pod with index 1 as well. \
\
\
\

